\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Exact cutoff audit and controls. Candidate periods one through four have the frozen exact degrees and no rational roots in either coordinate implementation. Controls recover \(2^n\), signed Chebyshev values, the odd raw prime \(3\), and complete removal of the spurious formal period-two component at \(c=-3/4\). Only the analytic divisibility chain supports an all-period inference.}}{6}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:exact-audit-controls}{{2}{6}{Exact cutoff audit and controls. Candidate periods one through four have the frozen exact degrees and no rational roots in either coordinate implementation. Controls recover \(2^n\), signed Chebyshev values, the odd raw prime \(3\), and complete removal of the spurious formal period-two component at \(c=-3/4\). Only the analytic divisibility chain supports an all-period inference}{figure.2}{}}
