\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Scope of the cotangent relation. Each regular branch preserves \(p\,dq\) and carries a zero-section return multiplier to a reciprocal pair. The critical line \(q=0\), overlapping branch images, and unbounded phase space rule out interpreting the formula as a global compact symplectomorphism.}}{7}{figure.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:symplectic-scope}{{3}{7}{Scope of the cotangent relation. Each regular branch preserves \(p\,dq\) and carries a zero-section return multiplier to a reciprocal pair. The critical line \(q=0\), overlapping branch images, and unbounded phase space rule out interpreting the formula as a global compact symplectomorphism}{figure.3}{}}
